 y sharing his debut novel\, Tear the City Down. Please join us on Wednesda
 y\, October 16 starting at 6:30 pm at Union Church (Connection Room\, 485 
 Columbus Ave.) for a fun and lively conversation in this author talk serie
 s!\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6aaad8508cf597003f944db0\nFrom Pu
 shpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
