SUMMARY:Quabbin-Yesterday and Today
LOCATION:Hyde Park Library\, 35 Harvard Ave\, Hyde Park\, MA 02136
DESCRIPTION:This exhibit contrasts the Quabbin Reservoir when it was built 
 in the 1930s with what it has become today. It was recently featured at th
 e Massachusetts State House and is now going on the road to libraries in t
 he communities that receive their water from the Quabbin\, to help raise a
 wareness about the sacrifices it took to build the Quabbin as well as the 
